department-Cargo-description = Coordinate supplies, transport, requisitions, and custody for both operational sites.
department-Civilian-description = Support crew welfare and daily services at the Station and Containment Dimension.
department-Command-description = Coordinate site operations, department priorities, and cooperation between the Station and Containment Dimension.
department-CentralCommand-description = Manage the crew and keep them working efficiently.
department-Engineering-description = Keep both sites powered, pressurized, structurally sound, and ready for containment operations.
department-Medical-description = Provide cross-site medical care, exposure screening, treatment, and safe return-to-duty guidance.
department-Security-description = Protect personnel and property at either site, control access, and coordinate incident safety.
department-Science-description = Research Qlippoths and other discoveries across both sites under approved protocols.
department-Silicon-description = Obey your laws and serve the crew.
department-Specific-description = Jobs and assignments specific to a facility or operation.
